<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Vision wins A$29 mln Navy contract.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Vision wins A$29 mln Navy contract.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>High technology company Vision Systems Ltd said on Thursday its LADS Corp Ltd unit had signed a A$29 million five-year contract with the Royal Australian Navy.</p>
<p>Vision said LADS would provide operational support for the Navy's Laser Airborne Depth Sounder (LADS) unit which it uses for the hydrographic survey of Australia's coastal waters.</p>
<p>The contract was effective from the start of 1997, immediately after the expiration of LADS Corp's current operation and support contract on December 31, 1996, Vision said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
